\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Question-level recovery from late access blocking on Game24 with Qwen3-8B. Each row shows one of the 23 selected questions. Points denote the number of correct generations out of two paired seeds under full access (\textup  {Full}{}) and late access blocking (\textup  {LateBlock}{}). Lines connect the paired conditions for the same question. Rows are ordered by transition type, from the largest gains to declines, and by question ID within each type. The aggregate \textup  {Full}{}-to-\textup  {LateBlock}{} effect is $+39.1$ percentage points. The question-level view shows how recovery is distributed across the selected set.}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:question-recovery}{{3}{7}{Question-level recovery from late access blocking on Game24 with Qwen3-8B. Each row shows one of the 23 selected questions. Points denote the number of correct generations out of two paired seeds under full access (\fullaccess {}) and late access blocking (\lateblock {}). Lines connect the paired conditions for the same question. Rows are ordered by transition type, from the largest gains to declines, and by question ID within each type. The aggregate \fullaccess {}-to-\lateblock {} effect is $+39.1$ percentage points. The question-level view shows how recovery is distributed across the selected set}{figure.3}{}}
